entry.summary:
🚀 Exploring API Integration with Postman 🔧
In today’s fast-paced development cycle, API testing and integration are crucial for seamless communication between services. This week, I focused on strengthening my hands-on skills with Postman — a powerful tool for API development and testing.
Here’s what I explored:
🔹 Setting up REST API requests with parameters, headers, and authentication
💡 Example Test Script:

pm.test("Status code is 200", function () {
    pm.response.to.have.status(200);
});

🔍 Bonus: Explored mock servers and monitoring for real-time performance tracking of APIs.
📌 Whether you're validating microservices, automating regression tests, or integrating with Jenkins, Postman is a great way to ensure your APIs are reliable and consistent.
Have you used Postman for complex API testing or automation? I’d love to hear your experience or tips in the comments!




  APITesting #Postman #AutomationTesting #SDET #QualityEngineering #TestAutomation #QA #CI_CD #TechTalk #LearningJourney #SoftwareTesting
